  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Sostenibilidad del Modelo de Transporte Fluvial en la Amazona</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Program for the Sustainability of the River Transport Model in the Amazon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es mejorar la conectividad y brindar un adecuado acceso a servicios de embarque y desembarque, de salud y de educacin de los habitantes de las comunidades ribereas de los ros Nanay, Napo, Huallaga, Maran, Ucayali, Santiago y Amazonas de forma sostenible.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to improve connectivity and provide adequate access to shipping and landing services, health, and education for the inhabitants of the communities along the Nanay, Napo, Huallaga, Maran, Ucayali, Santiago, and Amazonas rivers in a sustainable manner.</narrative>
  </description>
